    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Normalized Ancestry Feat.</strong> Formerly granted automatically by <em>Oldenborn (Ember-Touched)</em> at level 11; now available as an optional ancestry feat.</p><p><em>“You do not burn out. You burn <strong>through</strong>.”</em></p>\n        <p><strong>Sun-Scar.</strong> You gain resistance to radiant damage. When you succeed on a saving throw, you may deal psychic damage equal to your proficiency bonus to a creature within 10 feet (your aura flares).</p>",
